"santizhu059-a-55af77f3c9fa16f74f99","label":"正文","text":"评曰：孙登居心所存足为茂美之德；虑、和并有好善之姿，或短命早终或不得其死；霸以庶干嫡、奋不遵轨度，固取危亡之道，然奋之诛夷横遇飞祸","evidence":["santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0051","role":"评五子","evidence":["santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435","source_order":[59,293,0],"order":10503},{"id":"hequan-e-o197","title":"评曰山越难安孙权卑词魏氏诸臣克宁内难","accounts":[{"id":"hequan-a-c0f30d0448becd47d08c","label":"正文·评（陈寿评曰）","text":"陈寿总评五臣：山越难安易动，孙权不遑外御、卑词魏氏，诸臣克宁内难；吕岱清恪在公、周鲂谲略多奇、钟离牧蹈长者之规、全琮有当世之才而不检奸子","evidence":["hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0051","role":"评四臣克宁内难","evidence":["hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153"]},"ordering_evidence":"hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153","source_order":[60,428,0],"order":10699},{"id":"panlu-e-o060","title":"评曰潘濬陆凯陆胤风节","accounts":[{"id":"panlu-a-697eed5973b2440a6f80","label":"正文·评（陈寿评曰）","text":"评曰潘濬陆凯陆胤风节","evidence":["panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0051","role":"评潘濬陆凯陆胤风节","evidence":["panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497"]},"ordering_evidence":"panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497","source_order":[61,269,0],"order":10779},{"id":"santizhu064-e-sr-chenshu-comment","title":"陈寿评诸葛恪、滕胤、孙峻、孙綝、濮阳兴五传","accounts":[{"id":"santizhu064-a-956aa1581771f2102170","label":"正文","text":"评曰：恪才气干略邦人所称，然骄且吝矜已陵人能无败乎；胤厉修士操遵蹈规矩而孙峻之时犹保其贵必危之理也；峻綝凶竖盈溢固无足论；兴身居宰辅虑不经国，协张布之邪纳万彧之说，诛夷其宜矣","evidence":["santizhu064-q-b396352cd035ea11f7f3"]}],"participants":[{"person":"zhuge-p0051","role":"评五传主","evidence":["santizhu064-q-b396352cd035ea11f7f3"]}],"place":null,"time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"未由相邻段落推算纪年；原文时间表达保留在来源引句中。","evidence":["santizhu064-q-b396352cd035ea11f7f3"]},"ordering_evidence":"santizhu064-q-b396352cd035ea11f7f3","source_order":[64,552,0],"order":11054}],"persons":[{"id":"zhuge-p0051","name":"陈寿","evidence":["zhuge-q-o074","sunshi-q-p022","mantian-q-92927df21649c665fe83","huanchen-q-2929c6b6b5c74f0fdd1a","panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497","hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153","chengguo-q-efa7c1d916969b43a097","huowang-q-d72d78a78c202a947db3","duzhou-q-49cfb409ce0c525e4986","duzhou-q-ade149e28b148645916d"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"zhuge-m-o074-zhuge-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o074"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-o080-zhuge-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-o080"]},{"id":"zhuge-m-p054-zhuge-p0051","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["zhuge-q-p054"]},{"id":"sunshi-m-p022-zhuge-p0051","kind":"allusion","text":"祖系或典故提及","evidence":["sunshi-q-p022"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"chengguo-q-8efb7303d97062c67f1b","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-76bcbdfed5b4ce859b38","layer":"original","quote":"才计优资〖10〗，而自修不如也〖11〗。放、资，既善承顺主上，又未尝显言得失，抑辛毗而助王思〖12〗，以是获讥于世；然时因群臣谏诤，扶赞其义，并时〖13〗密陈损益〖14〗，不专导谀言云","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":515,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":2,"end":94,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"chengguo-q-efa7c1d916969b43a097","section":"chapter-014","block":"b-57a9a3cba323ea6c6c3e","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：程昱、郭嘉、董昭、刘晔、蒋济，才策谋略，世之奇士；虽清治德业〖1〗，殊于荀攸〖2〗；而筹画所料，是其伦也。刘放文翰，孙资勤慎，并管喉舌；权闻当时，雅亮非体〖3〗；是故讥谀之声〖4〗，每过其实矣","section_title":"程郭董刘蒋刘传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0033.xhtml","index":539,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":99,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-49cfb409ce0c525e4986","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-6d35f48147a0c734cf13","layer":"original","quote":"五年〖5〗，予尝为本郡中正〖6〗。清定事讫〖7〗，求休还家，往与周别","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":342,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":34,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-a987a34be6a338b0c10a","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-8eae06e73918e4e30c50","layer":"modern","quote":"〖5〗五年：西晋武帝泰始五年（公元 269）。","attribution":"现代注释","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":350,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-0f3eb3821b6441353f84","start":0,"end":23,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"duzhou-q-ade149e28b148645916d","section":"chapter-042","block":"b-6d35f48147a0c734cf13","layer":"original","quote":"周语予曰：“昔孔子七十二，刘向、扬雄七十一而没〖8〗；今吾年过七十，庶慕孔子遗风，可与刘、扬同轨：恐不出后岁，必便长逝，不复相见矣","section_title":"杜周杜许孟来尹李谯郤传第十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0090.xhtml","index":342,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":35,"end":100,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"hequan-q-6aa6c6f2a54821529153","section":"chapter-060","block":"b-08aa3315eec1e30f8b1c","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：山越好为叛乱，难安易动；是以孙权不遑外御，卑词魏氏〖1〗。凡此诸臣，皆克宁内难，绥静邦域者也。吕岱清恪在公。周鲂谲略多奇。钟离牧蹈长者之规。全琮有当世之才〖2〗，贵重于时；然不检奸子〖3〗，获讥毁名云","section_title":"贺全吕周钟离传第十五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0127.xhtml","index":427,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":103,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huanchen-q-2929c6b6b5c74f0fdd1a","section":"chapter-022","block":"b-c244875cc30f324b80d0","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：桓阶识睹成败，才周当世〖1〗。陈群动仗名义，有清流雅望；泰弘济简至〖2〗，允克堂构矣〖3〗。魏世事统台阁〖4〗，重内轻外；故八座尚书〖5〗，即古六卿之任也〖6〗。陈、徐、卫、卢，久居斯位；矫、宣刚断骨鲠；臻、毓规鉴清理：咸不忝厥职云","section_title":"桓二陈徐卫卢传第二十二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0050.xhtml","index":604,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":119,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"huowang-q-d72d78a78c202a947db3","section":"chapter-041","block":"b-4dcb6200f55cc020b124","layer":"pei","quote":"四年三月，从帝宴于华林园，诏问蜀大臣子弟，后问先辈宜时叙用者；宪荐蜀郡常忌、杜轸、寿良，巴西陈寿，南郡高轨，（高）〔南〕阳吕雅、许国，江夏费恭，琅邪诸葛京，汝南陈裕：即皆叙用，咸显于世","attribution":"裴注·襄阳记","section_title":"霍王向张杨费传第十一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0088.xhtml","index":25,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-c480ade0f0913bd6d1da","start":593,"end":685,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"mantian-q-92927df21649c665fe83","section":"chapter-026","block":"b-ebd1963bc8381f309d9e","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：满宠立志刚毅，勇而有谋；田豫居身清白，规略明练〖1〗；牵招秉义壮烈，威绩显著；郭淮方策精详，垂问秦、雍〖2〗。而豫位止小州〖3〗，招终于郡守：未尽其用也","section_title":"满田牵郭传第二十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0058.xhtml","index":377,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":79,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"panlu-q-d8cf2904bf05e4297497","section":"chapter-061","block":"b-3d61488b0ea3fc66bc2f","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：潘濬公清割断〖1〗，陆凯忠壮质直：皆节概梗梗〖2〗，有大丈夫格业〖3〗。胤身洁事济，著称南土，可谓良牧矣","section_title":"潘濬陆凯传第十六","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0129.xhtml","index":268,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":55,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu-q-c4a2ec56c75de104036c","section":"chapter-048","block":"b-8b876bfb164d6b3d6b1f","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：孙亮童孺，而无贤辅；其替位不终，必然之势也。休，以旧爱宿恩，任用兴、布；不能拔进良才，改弦易张：虽志善好学，何益救乱乎？又使既废之亮，不得其死，友于之义薄矣〖1〗！皓之淫刑所滥，陨毙流黜者，盖不可胜数。是以群下人人惴恐，皆日日以冀，朝不谋夕。其荧惑、巫祝，交致祥瑞，以为至急。昔舜、禹躬稼〖2〗，至圣之德；犹或矢誓众臣，予违汝弼〖3〗；或拜昌言〖4〗，常若不及。况皓凶顽，肆行残暴；忠谏者诛，谗谀者进；虐用其民，穷淫极侈：宜腰首分离，以谢百姓。既蒙不死之诏，复加归命之宠；岂非旷荡之恩，过厚之泽也哉！","section_title":"三嗣主传第三","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0103.xhtml","index":557,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":253,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu059-q-0fc3620f8ad6f1f53435","section":"chapter-059","block":"b-20d8fa185cfbf4b2aee0","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：孙登居心所存，足为茂美之德。虑、和并有好善之姿〖1〗，规自砥砺〖2〗；或短命早终，或不得其死：哀哉！霸以庶干嫡，奋不遵轨度，固取危亡之道也；然奋之诛夷，横遇飞祸矣。","section_title":"吴主五子传第十四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0125.xhtml","index":292,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":85,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"santizhu064-q-b396352cd035ea11f7f3","section":"chapter-064","block":"b-ec39395b0f32720b203e","layer":"original","quote":"评曰：诸葛恪才气干略，邦人所称。然骄且吝〖1〗，周公无观；况在于恪？矜已陵人，能无败乎？若躬行所与陆逊及弟融之书，则悔吝不至，何尤祸之有哉〖2〗！滕胤厉修士操，遵蹈规矩；而孙峻之时犹保其贵，必危之理也。峻、綝凶竖盈溢〖3〗，固无足论者。濮阳兴身居宰辅，虑不经国〖4〗；协张布之邪〖5〗，纳万彧之说：诛夷其宜矣！","section_title":"诸葛滕二孙濮阳传第十九","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0135.xhtml","index":551,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":155,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"sunshi-q-p022","section":"chapter-046","block":"b-3125ede41427e4246908","layer":"pei","quote":"虞喜《志林》曰：“天子六玺者，文曰‘皇帝之玺’、‘皇帝行玺’、‘皇帝信玺’、‘天子之玺’、‘天子行玺’、‘天子信玺’。此六玺，所封事异，故文字不同。《献帝起居注》云‘从河上还，得六玉玺于阁上’，此之谓也。传国玺者，乃汉高祖所佩秦皇帝玺，世世传受，号曰‘传国玺’。按传国玺，不在六玺之数，安得总其说乎？应氏《汉官》、皇甫《世纪》，其论六玺，文义皆符。汉宫传国玺，文曰‘受命于天，既寿且康’。‘且康’、‘永昌’，二字为错，未知两家，何者为得？金玉之精，率有光气；加以神器秘宝，辉耀益彰：盖一代之奇观，将来之异闻。而以不解之故，强谓之‘伪’，不亦诬乎？陈寿为《破虏传》亦除此说，俱惑《起居注》；不知六玺殊名，与传国为七者也。吴时无能刻玉，故天子以金为玺；玺虽以金，于文不异。吴降而送玺者，送天子六玺；曩所得玉玺，乃古人遗印，不可施用。天子之玺，今以无有为难，不通其义者耳。”","attribution":"虞喜《志林》","section_title":"孙破虏讨逆传第一","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0099.xhtml","index":166,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-1bc54606724bd9fea7a4","start":0,"end":384,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o074a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-96d90e7e8282428156de","layer":"original","quote":"臣寿等言：臣前在著作郎〖1〗，侍中、领中书监、济北侯臣荀勖，中书令、关内侯臣和峤奏〖2〗，使臣定故蜀丞相诸葛亮故事〖3〗。亮毗佐危国〖4〗，负阻不宾；然犹存录其言，耻善有遗〖5〗：诚是大晋光明至德，泽被无疆。自古以来，未之有伦也〖6〗。辄删除复重，随类相从，凡为二十四篇，篇名如右。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-e-o080a-q","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-b7195418fcd5fc0b078b","layer":"original","quote":"臣寿诚惶诚恐〖49〗，顿首顿首〖50〗，死罪死罪！泰始十年二月一日癸巳，平阳侯相臣陈寿上〖51〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o074","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-96d90e7e8282428156de","layer":"original","quote":"臣寿等言：臣前在著作郎〖1〗，侍中、领中书监、济北侯臣荀勖，中书令、关内侯臣和峤奏〖2〗，使臣定故蜀丞相诸葛亮故事〖3〗。亮毗佐危国〖4〗，负阻不宾；然犹存录其言，耻善有遗〖5〗：诚是大晋光明至德，泽被无疆。自古以来，未之有伦也〖6〗。辄删除复重，随类相从，凡为二十四篇，篇名如右。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":345,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":141,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-o080","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-b7195418fcd5fc0b078b","layer":"original","quote":"臣寿诚惶诚恐〖49〗，顿首顿首〖50〗，死罪死罪！泰始十年二月一日癸巳，平阳侯相臣陈寿上〖51〗。","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":351,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":49,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"zhuge-q-p054","section":"chapter-035","block":"b-c757579021f8983017ea","layer":"pei","quote":"﹝二﹞孙盛《异同记》曰：“瞻、厥等以维好战无功，国内疲弊；宜表后主，召还为益州刺史，夺其兵权。蜀长老犹有瞻表‘以阎宇代维’故事。晋永和三年，蜀史常璩说蜀长老云：‘陈寿尝为瞻吏，为瞻所辱；故因此事归恶黄皓，而云瞻不能匡矫也。’”","attribution":"孙盛《异同记》","section_title":"诸葛亮传第五","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0076.xhtml","index":453,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-728adfc2b17d8d199f48","start":0,"end":113,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
